{'symbol': 'AZO', 'date': '2022-03-29 09:17:00', 'title': "LECTRON UNVEILS NEW RETAIL PARTNERSHIP WITH AUTOZONE, AMERICA'S LEADING AUTO PARTS RETAILER", 'text': "STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP EXPANDS LECTRON'S RETAIL FOOTPRINT WHILE HIGHLIGHTING THE PUSH TOWARD MAINSTREAM ELECTRIC VEHICLE ADOPTION MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., MARCH 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LECTRON, THE NATION'S LEADING ELECTRIC VEHICLE CHARGING BRAND, HAS ENTERED A RETAIL PARTNERSHIP WITH AUTO PARTS GIANT, AUTOZONE (NYSE: AZO), IN A BID TO MAKE ELECTRIC VEHICLE CHARGING MORE ACCESSIBLE TO CONSUMERS."}